<view class="page"><text class="title">后台登录确认</text><text class="notice">只确认自己在电脑上主动发起的登录。配对码不是微信动态码，不要替他人确认。</text><input placeholder="电脑显示的22位配对码" value="{{pairCode}}" maxlength="22" disabled="{{busy || approved}}" bindinput="onPairInput"/><button disabled="{{busy || approved}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="inspect">重新微信登录并核验配对</button><view wx:if="{{preview}}"><text>授权目标：{{preview.audience}}</text><text wx:if="{{preview.provider === 'mock'}}" class="error">当前为隔离Mock验收，不是真实微信身份核验。</text><input type="number" password placeholder="电脑显示的六位核对数字" maxlength="6" value="{{confirmationCode}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindinput="onCodeInput"/><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="approve">确认登录我的电脑</button></view><text wx:if="{{approved}}">已确认。请返回原电脑领取会话，再独立完成验证器MFA。</text><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view>
